    <symbol id="i-user" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="3.5"/><path d="M4.5 21a7.5 7.5 0 0 1 15 0"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="i-cap" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M2 9l10-5 10 5-10 5L2 9Z"/><path d="M6 11v5c0 1.7 2.7 3 6 3s6-1.3 6-3v-5M22 9v6"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="i-pen" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 20l4-1L19 8a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4-4L4 15l-1 5h1Z"/><path d="M13.5 5.5l5 5"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="i-trash" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 7h16M9 7V4h6v3M6 7l1 14h10l1-14M10 11v6M14 11v6"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="i-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="i-seal" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l2.4 2.1 3.2-.2.8 3.1 2.6 1.9-1.1 3 1.1 3-2.6 1.9-.8 3.1-3.2-.2L12 22l-2.4-2.1-3.2.2-.8-3.1L3 15l1.1-3L3 9l2.6-1.9.8-3.1 3.2.2L12 2Z"/><path d="M8.5 12l2.2 2.2 4.8-4.8"/></symbol>
  </svg>

  <div id="app">
    <div class="boot-splash" role="status">
      <div class="boot-cross" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <p>正在整理新生档案…</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="toast-region" id="toast-region" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></div>

  <dialog class="confirm-dialog" id="confirm-dialog">
    <form method="dialog" class="confirm-shell">
      <p class="dialog-eyebrow">CONFIRMATION</p>
      <h2 id="confirm-title">确认操作</h2>
      <p id="confirm-body" class="dialog-body"></p>
      <div class="dialog-actions">
        <button class="btn btn-ghost" value="cancel">先不要</button>
        <button class="btn btn-danger" id="confirm-ok" value="confirm">确认</button>
      </div>
    </form>
  </dialog>

  <noscript>
    <div class="noscript-card">本游戏需要启用 JavaScript 才能建立学籍档案。请在浏览器设置中允许 JavaScript 后刷新页面。</div>
  </noscript>

  <script src="data.js" defer></script>
  <script src="app.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>

# 医学生模拟器 · 序章「白袍之前」

一款从本科到博士的文字回合制医学生模拟游戏。一回合 = 一周：上课、翘课、科研、打工、吃饭、随机事件与考试，最终走向毕业、延毕或肄业。

当前版本完成了整个**开局模块**：从封面建立新生档案，到领取录取通知书、经历报到日，最终将学籍归档。

> 在线试玩（GitHub Pages 发布后）：
> `https://<你的GitHub用户名>.github.io/medical-student-simulator/`

![医学生模拟器 · 封面](preview-cover.png)

## 玩法与当前范围

- 六步建档：姓名 → 天资 → 属性 → 家庭 → 初始能力 → 院校 → 核对
- 姓名可留空；留空时全文以「你」称呼，录取通知书和证书同样处理
- 实时学籍档案侧栏，随选择更新
- 完整规则校验：属性点必须用完、单项 3–10 点、能力点不可超上限
- 六种家庭背景、四种院校，以及各自的经济、导师/科研与竞争规则
- 录取通知书、学校/家庭专属报到叙事、学籍归档页
- 自动保存草稿；刷新或离开后可继续建档
- 桌面端、平板与手机端适配

**本阶段结束于序章归档页**。归档存档中已写入姓名、天资、六项属性、家庭、初始能力、院校与学号；本科第一周的回合循环会在下一阶段接入。

## 人物卡内容

### 天资

| 天资 | 开局属性点 | 能力点 | 每学年成长点 |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| 普通 | 30 | 5 | +2 |
| 优秀 | 35 | 8 | +3 |
| 精英 | 40 | 12 | +4 |
| 天才 | 50 | 16 | +6 |

每项属性最少投入 3 点，上限 10 点。

### 家庭背景

| 家庭 | 开局资金 | 周期支持 | 特殊规则 |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| 孤儿 | ¥200 | 每 4 周 +¥500 | 餐费全免，政府补助 |
| 贫穷家庭 | ¥1,000 | 申请后每 4 周 +¥500 | 每次开学可申请助学金；获批后餐费全免，部分事件选项受限 |
| 工薪阶层 | ¥5,000 | 每 4 周 +¥2,000 | — |
| 富裕家庭 | ¥10,000 | 每 4 周 +¥3,000 | — |
| 医学世家 | ¥5,000 | 每 4 周 +¥2,000 | 开局解锁导师与科研 |
| 家财万贯 | ¥100,000 | 每 4 周 +¥50,000 | — |

### 初始能力

| 能力 | 消耗 | 效果 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 乐天派 | 2 点 | 压力上限 +10；每周额外降低 5 点压力 |
| 高精力人士 | 3 点 | 体力上限 +20；每周额外恢复 10 点体力 |
| 梦境中人 | 2 点 | 与每个人的初始好感度 +10 |
| 时间管理大师 | 4 点 | 学习、科研与副业效率 +10% |

### 院校

二本院校 / 一本院校 / 985 高校 / 老八校。院校影响竞争强度、年度排名压力与特殊事件倾向。

## 本地运行

纯静态网页，无构建依赖。

```powershell
cd med-sim
python -m http.server 8765 --bind 127.0.0.1
```

打开 `http://127.0.0.1:8765/`。

也可以直接双击 `index.html` 打开；使用本地 HTTP 服务能保证浏览器存档行为一致。

## 发布到 GitHub Pages

1. 在 GitHub 新建公开仓库 `medical-student-simulator`，不要勾选初始化 README。
2. 将本项目所有文件上传到仓库根目录并提交。
3. 打开仓库 **Settings → Pages**。
4. **Source** 选择 `Deploy from a branch`，Branch 选择 `main`，目录选择 `/ (root)`，保存。
5. 等待约 1 分钟，访问：
   `https://<你的GitHub用户名>.github.io/medical-student-simulator/`

## 本地存档

浏览器 `localStorage`：

- `medsim.draft.v1`：建档草稿
- `medsim.save.v1`：已报到 / 已归档的学籍档案

清除站点数据会同时清除游戏进度。

## 文件结构

```text
index.html    页面骨架、图标 sprite、确认弹窗
styles.css    全部界面样式与响应式规则
data.js       天资 / 属性 / 家庭 / 能力 / 院校配置
app.js        页面渲染、校验、存档、序章流程
favicon.svg   医学档案风格图标
preview-*.png 项目预览图
```

## 下一阶段

从 `medsim.save.v1` 继续实现：

- 每周课程与出勤、翘课空余时间、三餐价位
- 体力 / 压力 / 金钱结算
- 每 4 周家庭支持与助学金
- 8 周 / 16 周课程、复习周、考试与成绩
- 寒暑假、打工 / 游玩 / 学习
- 年度排名、特殊事件与后续硕博路线

/* =========================================================
   医学生模拟器 · 序章
   Editorial medical-school dossier interface
   ========================================================= */

:root {
  --paper: #f2ecdd;
  --paper-deep: #e9e0ce;
  --paper-light: #faf6eb;
  --ink: #182720;
  --ink-soft: #4d5c54;
  --ink-faint: #626d65;
  --teal: #163b34;
  --teal-deep: #0e2b26;
  --teal-soft: #2c5a50;
  --sage: #87968a;
  --sage-light: #c7cfc1;
  --red: #ae3b2f;
  --red-deep: #862a21;
  --red-soft: #d17463;
  --gold: #a67a45;
  --gold-light: #d6bd93;
  --line: rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.16);
  --line-strong: rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.3);
  --line-light: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.18);
  --shadow-sm: 0 8px 22px rgba(35, 42, 33, 0.07);
  --shadow-md: 0 20px 50px rgba(35, 42, 33, 0.12);
  --shadow-card: 7px 7px 0 rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.09);
  --font-serif: "Songti SC", "STSong", "Noto Serif SC", "Source Han Serif SC", "SimSun", serif;
  --font-sans: "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", "Noto Sans SC", "Hiragino Sans GB", system-ui, sans-serif;
  --font-mono: "Cascadia Mono", "SFMono-Regular", "Consolas", "Liberation Mono", "Courier New", monospace;
  --page-pad: clamp(20px, 4vw, 58px);
  --radius: 3px;
}

*,
*::before,
*::after {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

html {
  min-width: 320px;
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
  background: var(--paper);
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  min-width: 320px;
  min-height: 100svh;
  background:
    radial-gradient(120% 80% at 8% 0%, rgba(255, 252, 242, 0.78), transparent 60%),
    var(--paper);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.65;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
}

body::before {
  content: "";
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 220 220' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.82' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='0.42'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
  opacity: 0.055;
  mix-blend-mode: multiply;
}

body::after {
  content: "";
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  background:
    linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0 49.9%, rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.018) 50%, transparent 50.1%),
    linear-gradient(transparent 0 49.9%, rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.018) 50%, transparent 50.1%);
  background-size: 64px 64px;
  opacity: 0.5;
}

body.is-locked {
  overflow: hidden;
}

button,
input,
select,
textarea {
  font: inherit;
}

button {
  color: inherit;
}

button,
a {
  -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
}

a {
  color: var(--teal);
  text-decoration-color: rgba(22, 59, 52, 0.35);
  text-underline-offset: 0.23em;
}

a:hover {
  color: var(--red);
}

img,
svg {
  display: block;
  max-width: 100%;
}

h1,
h2,
h3,
h4,
p {
  margin: 0;
}

h1,
h2,
h3 {
  text-wrap: balance;
}

p {
  text-wrap: pretty;
}

::selection {
  background: var(--red);
  color: var(--paper-light);
}

:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--red);
  outline-offset: 3px;
}

.svg-sprite {
  position: absolute;
  width: 0;
  height: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.icon {
  width: 20px;
  height: 20px;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  fill: none;
  stroke: currentColor;
  stroke-width: 1.65;
  stroke-linecap: round;
  stroke-linejoin: round;
}

.skip-link {
  position: fixed;
  top: 8px;
  left: 8px;
  z-index: 3000;
  padding: 10px 14px;
  background: var(--teal);
  color: var(--paper);
  transform: translateY(-180%);
  transition: transform 160ms ease;
}

.skip-link:focus {
  transform: translateY(0);
  color: var(--paper);
}

#app {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  min-height: 100svh;
}

.boot-splash {
  min-height: 100svh;
  display: grid;
  place-content: center;
  justify-items: center;
  gap: 18px;
  color: var(--ink-soft);
}

.boot-cross {
  width: 36px;
  height: 36px;
  position: relative;
}

.boot-cross::before,
.boot-cross::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  background: var(--red);
}

.boot-cross::before {
  width: 100%;
  height: 1px;
  top: 50%;
}

.boot-cross::after {
  height: 100%;
  width: 1px;
  left: 50%;
}

.mono {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.eyebrow {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.68rem;
  line-height: 1.4;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
}

.rule {
  border: 0;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  margin: 0;
}

/* ---------- Buttons ---------- */

.btn {
  --btn-bg: transparent;
  --btn-fg: var(--ink);
  --btn-border: var(--line-strong);
  position: relative;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 12px;
  min-height: 48px;
  padding: 12px 21px;
  border: 1px solid var(--btn-border);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  background: var(--btn-bg);
  color: var(--btn-fg);
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 0.92rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1.2;
  letter-spacing: 0.035em;
  text-align: center;
  text-decoration: none;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition:
    transform 160ms ease,
    box-shadow 160ms ease,
    background-color 160ms ease,
    border-color 160ms ease,
    color 160ms ease;
}

.btn .icon {
  width: 18px;
  height: 18px;
  transition: transform 180ms ease;
}

.btn-primary {
  --btn-bg: var(--teal);
  --btn-fg: var(--paper-light);
  --btn-border: var(--teal);
  box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 rgba(22, 59, 52, 0.14);
}

.btn-primary:hover {
  --btn-bg: var(--teal-soft);
  --btn-border: var(--teal-soft);
  color: var(--paper-light);
  transform: translate(-1px, -1px);
  box-shadow: 7px 7px 0 rgba(22, 59, 52, 0.16);
}

.btn-primary:hover .icon-arrow,
.btn-outline:hover .icon-arrow {
  transform: translateX(4px);
}

.btn-outline {
  --btn-border: var(--ink);
  background: transparent;
}

.btn-outline:hover {
  --btn-bg: var(--ink);
  --btn-fg: var(--paper-light);
  color: var(--paper-light);
  transform: translate(-1px, -1px);
  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.13);
}

.btn-ghost {
  --btn-border: var(--line);
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-weight: 500;
}

.btn-ghost:hover {
  --btn-border: var(--line-strong);
  background: rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.045);
  color: var(--ink);
}

.btn-danger {
  --btn-bg: var(--red);
  --btn-fg: #fff8ed;
  --btn-border: var(--red);
}

.btn-danger:hover {
  --btn-bg: var(--red-deep);
  --btn-border: var(--red-deep);
}

.btn:disabled {
  cursor: not-allowed;
  opacity: 0.52;
  box-shadow: none;
  transform: none;
}

.btn-sm {
  min-height: 38px;
  padding: 8px 13px;
  font-size: 0.8rem;
}

.text-btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 7px;
  padding: 4px 0;
  border: 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.3);
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: color 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease;
}

.text-btn:hover {
  color: var(--red);
  border-color: var(--red);
}

.text-btn .icon {
  width: 15px;
  height: 15px;
}

/* ---------- Brand / shared headers ---------- */

.brand {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  color: var(--ink);
  text-decoration: none;
}

.brand-mark {
  width: 38px;
  height: 38px;
  border: 1px solid var(--teal);
  border-radius: 50%;
  position: relative;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
}

.brand-mark::before,
.brand-mark::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  background: var(--red);
}

.brand-mark::before {
  width: 15px;
  height: 1px;
}

.brand-mark::after {
  width: 1px;
  height: 15px;
}

.brand-mark span {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 5px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(22, 59, 52, 0.16);
  border-radius: 50%;
}

.brand-text {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 1px;
}

.brand-text strong {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.25;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
}

.brand-text small {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.55rem;
  line-height: 1.35;
  letter-spacing: 0.15em;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
}

.stamp {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border: 1.5px solid var(--red);
  color: var(--red);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  opacity: 0.88;
}

/* ---------- Cover ---------- */

.cover-screen {
  position: relative;
  isolation: isolate;
  min-height: 100svh;
  overflow-x: hidden;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  padding: 0 var(--page-pad);
}

.cover-screen::before {
  content: "醫";
  position: absolute;
  top: 11%;
  left: 20%;
  z-index: -1;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: clamp(380px, 56vw, 820px);
  line-height: 0.72;
  color: transparent;
  -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.055);
  transform: rotate(-4deg);
  pointer-events: none;
  user-select: none;
}

.cover-screen::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 20%;
  right: -180px;
  z-index: -1;
  width: 620px;
  height: 620px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.08);
  border-radius: 50%;
  box-shadow:
    0 0 0 64px rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.018),
    0 0 0 128px rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.012);
  pointer-events: none;
}

.cover-header {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 1480px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 24px 0 18px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 22px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.cover-header-meta {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.62rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.cover-header-meta .meta-separator {
  width: 24px;
  height: 1px;
  background: var(--line-strong);
}

.cover-header-meta .meta-dot {
  width: 5px;
  height: 5px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--red);
}

.cover-main {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 1480px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  flex: 1;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.08fr) minmax(340px, 0.72fr);
  gap: clamp(38px, 7vw, 110px);
  align-items: center;
  padding: clamp(38px, 6vh, 76px) 0 clamp(36px, 7vh, 84px);
}

.cover-copy {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
  max-width: 790px;
}

.cover-kicker {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 13px;
  margin-bottom: clamp(22px, 3.4vh, 34px);
  color: var(--red);
}

.cover-kicker::before {
  content: "";
  width: 31px;
  height: 2px;
  background: var(--red);
}

.cover-kicker span:first-child {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.64rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
}

.cover-kicker span:last-child {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.2em;
}

.cover-title {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: clamp(76px, 9.4vw, 146px);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 0.89;
  letter-spacing: -0.055em;
  color: var(--ink);
}

.cover-title:focus,
.step-heading h1:focus,
.arrival-title:focus,
.result-hero h1:focus,
.admission-letter:focus {
  outline: none;
}

.cover-title-line {
  display: block;
  position: relative;
  width: max-content;
  max-width: 100%;
}

.cover-title-line:last-child {
  margin-left: clamp(18px, 4vw, 66px);
  color: transparent;
  -webkit-text-stroke: 1.4px var(--ink);
}

.cover-title .title-period {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-left: 0.08em;
  color: var(--red);
  -webkit-text-stroke: 0;
  font-size: 0.45em;
  vertical-align: 0.55em;
  line-height: 1;
}

.cover-title-note {
  position: absolute;
  top: 44%;
  right: -22px;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.56rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  writing-mode: vertical-rl;
  -webkit-text-stroke: 0;
}

.cover-intro {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
  gap: 28px;
  align-items: end;
  margin-top: clamp(28px, 4.4vh, 43px);
  padding-top: 25px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
}

.cover-lede {
  max-width: 490px;
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: clamp(0.98rem, 1.2vw, 1.1rem);
  line-height: 1.95;
  letter-spacing: 0.035em;
}

.cover-lede strong {
  color: var(--ink);
  font-weight: 700;
}

.cover-actions {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: stretch;
  gap: 10px;
  min-width: 186px;
}

.cover-secondary-links {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 2px 14px;
}

.cover-secondary-links .text-btn {
  font-size: 0.68rem;
  border-bottom-color: transparent;
}

.cover-secondary-links .text-btn:hover {
  border-bottom-color: var(--red);
}

.cover-actions .btn {
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding-inline: 17px;
}

.cover-actions .text-btn {
  align-self: center;
  margin-top: 2px;
}

.cover-footnote {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 9px;
  margin-top: 14px;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.58rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.11em;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.cover-footnote .footnote-mark {
  width: 4px;
  height: 4px;
  background: var(--red);
  border-radius: 50%;
}

.cover-facts {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px 24px;
  margin-top: clamp(26px, 4.5vh, 48px);
  color: var(--ink-soft);
}

.cover-facts .fact {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  gap: 8px;
}

.cover-facts b {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1.02rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.07em;
}

.cover-facts span {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.58rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
}

.cover-facts .fact-arrow {
  color: var(--red);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.7rem;
}

.cover-art {
  position: relative;
  width: min(100%, 456px);
  justify-self: end;
  padding: 28px 8px 40px 18px;
}

.cover-art::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 8% 0 10% 3%;
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(rgba(22, 59, 52, 0.055) 1px, transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(22, 59, 52, 0.055) 1px, transparent 1px);
  background-size: 18px 18px;
  mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #000 14%, #000 85%, transparent);
  pointer-events: none;
}

.art-orbit {
  position: absolute;
  top: 2%;
  right: -33%;
  width: 510px;
  height: 510px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.16);
  border-radius: 50%;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.art-orbit::before,
.art-orbit::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  border-radius: 50%;
}

.art-orbit::before {
  inset: 34px;
  border: 1px dashed rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.12);
}

.art-orbit::after {
  width: 8px;
  height: 8px;
  top: 55px;
  left: 88px;
  background: var(--red);
}

.art-pulse {
  position: absolute;
  left: -9%;
  bottom: 15%;
  width: 118%;
  height: 72px;
  opacity: 0.25;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.art-pulse path {
  fill: none;
  stroke: var(--red);
  stroke-width: 1.2;
}

.archive-card {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
  width: calc(100% - 24px);
  margin-left: auto;
  padding: 34px 30px 24px;
  background:
    linear-gradient(115deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18), transparent 34%),
    var(--teal);
  color: var(--paper);
  border: 1px solid rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.38);
  box-shadow:
    15px 19px 0 rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.07),
    0 24px 45px rgba(35, 42, 33, 0.17);
  transform: rotate(1.6deg);
}

.archive-card::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 10px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.15);
  pointer-events: none;
}

.archive-tab {
  position: absolute;
  left: 28px;
  top: -28px;
  height: 28px;
  padding: 0 20px;
  background: var(--paper-deep);
  border: 1px solid rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.25);
  border-bottom: 0;
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.56rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
}

.archive-top {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 18px;
  padding-bottom: 17px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.2);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.55rem;
  line-height: 1.65;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.66);
}

.archive-top span:last-child {
  white-space: nowrap;
  color: var(--gold-light);
}

.archive-label {
  margin-top: 24px;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.56rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.53);
}

.archive-name {
  margin-top: 1px;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.3vw, 2.7rem);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.25;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: var(--paper-light);
}

.archive-rule {
  width: 100%;
  height: 1px;
  margin: 20px 0 17px;
  background: repeating-linear-gradient(
    90deg,
    rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.24) 0,
    rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.24) 3px,
    transparent 3px,
    transparent 7px
  );
}

.archive-rows {
  display: grid;
  gap: 13px;
}

.archive-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 20px;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
}

.archive-row span {
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.52);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.56rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.archive-row b {
  color: var(--paper);
  font-weight: 500;
  text-align: right;
}

.archive-quote {
  margin: 25px 0 0;
  padding-top: 19px;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.2);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 0.86rem;
  line-height: 1.8;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.7);
}

.archive-stamp {
  position: absolute;
  right: 26px;
  bottom: 54px;
  width: 75px;
  height: 75px;
  border: 1.5px solid var(--red-soft);
  outline: 1px solid rgba(209, 116, 99, 0.4);
  outline-offset: -5px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  color: var(--red-soft);
  display: grid;
  place-content: center;
  justify-items: center;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.18;
  letter-spacing: 0.15em;
  transform: rotate(-12deg);
  opacity: 0.93;
}

.archive-stamp::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  width: 18px;
  height: 1px;
  top: 17px;
  background: currentColor;
}

.archive-footer {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 20px;
  margin-top: 20px;
}

.barcode {
  height: 30px;
  flex: 1;
  max-width: 175px;
  background: repeating-linear-gradient(
    90deg,
    currentColor 0,
    currentColor 1px,
    transparent 1px,
    transparent 4px,
    currentColor 4px,
    currentColor 5px,
    transparent 5px,
    transparent 8px,
    currentColor 8px,
    currentColor 10px,
    transparent 10px,
    transparent 13px,
    currentColor 13px,
    currentColor 14px,
    transparent 14px,
    transparent 17px
  );
  opacity: 0.46;
}

.archive-footer small {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.5rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.42);
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.paperclip {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 3;
  top: 9px;
  right: 20px;
  width: 21px;
  height: 57px;
  border: 1.5px solid rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.47);
  border-radius: 12px;
  transform: rotate(9deg);
}

.paperclip::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 4px;
  left: 4px;
  width: 11px;
  height: 46px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.3);
  border-radius: 8px;
}

.archive-caption {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 12px;
  width: calc(100% - 32px);
  margin: 24px 0 0 auto;
  padding-left: 3px;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
}

.archive-caption span {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.54rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  color: var(--red);
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.archive-caption p {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  line-height: 1.8;
  letter-spacing: 0.03em;
}

.cover-footer {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 1480px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 15px 0 20px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 22px;
  align-items: center;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.55rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.11em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.cover-footer .footer-chapters {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 11px;
}

.cover-footer b {
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-weight: 500;
}

.cover-footer .footer-slash {
  color: var(--red);
}

/* ---------- Creator shell ---------- */

.creator-screen {
  min-height: 100svh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  background:
    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.014) 1px, transparent 1px);
  background-size: 32px 32px;
}

.creator-header {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 30;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  background: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.95);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
}

.creator-header-inner {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 1460px;
  min-height: 70px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 11px clamp(18px, 3vw, 42px);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 24px;
}

.creator-header .brand-mark {
  width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
}

.creator-header .brand-text strong {
  font-size: 0.92rem;
}

.creator-header .brand-text small {
  font-size: 0.5rem;
}

.creator-header-tools {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 23px;
}

.autosave-note {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 7px;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.55rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
}

.autosave-note::before {
  content: "";
  width: 5px;
  height: 5px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--sage);
}

.autosave-note.is-saved::before {
  background: var(--teal-soft);
}

.step-nav {
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  background: rgba(233, 224, 206, 0.55);
}

.step-nav-inner {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 1460px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 clamp(18px, 3vw, 42px);
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr));
}

.step-tab {
  position: relative;
  min-width: 0;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 11px;
  padding: 11px 15px 11px 14px;
  border: 0;
  border-top: 2px solid transparent;
  border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 0.73rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-align: left;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: color 160ms ease, background-color 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease;
}

.step-tab:last-child {
  border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.step-tab:disabled {
  cursor: default;
  opacity: 0.62;
}

.step-tab:not(:disabled):hover {
  background: rgba(250, 246, 235, 0.62);
  color: var(--ink);
}

.step-tab .step-tab-no {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.59rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
}

.step-tab .step-tab-label {
  white-space: nowrap;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
}

.step-tab[aria-current="step"] {
  background: var(--teal);
  border-top-color: var(--red);
  color: var(--paper-light);
  cursor: default;
  opacity: 1;
}

.step-tab[aria-current="step"] .step-tab-no {
  color: var(--gold-light);
}

.step-tab.is-done {
  color: var(--ink);
}

.step-tab.is-done .step-tab-no {
  color: var(--teal-soft);
}

.step-tab.is-done .step-tab-no::after {
  content: "✓";
  margin-left: 3px;
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  color: var(--red);
}

.creator-shell {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 1240px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  flex: 1;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 356px;
  gap: clamp(30px, 4vw, 56px);
  align-items: start;
  padding: clamp(26px, 4vw, 50px) clamp(18px, 3vw, 42px) 58px;
}

.form-pane {
  min-width: 0;
  padding-bottom: 18px;
}

.mobile-filebar {
  display: none;
}

.step-heading {
  position: relative;
  padding-bottom: 24px;
  margin-bottom: 30px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
}

.step-eyebrow {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.6rem;
  line-height: 1.45;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  color: var(--red);
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.step-eyebrow::after {
  content: "";
  width: 42px;
  height: 1px;
  background: var(--red);
  opacity: 0.5;
}

.step-title-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 17px;
}

.step-number {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 5vw, 4.8rem);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 0.72;
  letter-spacing: -0.06em;
  color: rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.13);
}

.step-heading h1 {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: clamp(2.05rem, 3.2vw, 2.9rem);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.18;
  letter-spacing: 0.015em;
}

.step-lead {
  max-width: 620px;
  margin: 15px 0 0;
  padding-left: 2px;
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 0.96rem;
  line-height: 1.9;
  letter-spacing: 0.025em;
}

.step-body {
  animation: step-in 360ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.75, 0.25, 1) both;
}

@keyframes step-in {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(11px);
  }
  to {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
}

.form-section + .form-section {
  margin-top: 40px;
  padding-top: 35px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.section-heading-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 17px;
}

.section-heading-row h2 {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 11px;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1.27rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.3;
  letter-spacing: 0.035em;
}

.section-heading-row h2::before {
  content: "";
  width: 5px;
  height: 5px;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--red);
}

.section-heading-row .section-meta {
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.56rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.11em;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.field-hint {
  margin-top: 9px;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  line-height: 1.75;
}

.field-hint strong {
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-weight: 600;
}

/* ---------- Name field ---------- */

.name-field {
  position: relative;
}

.name-label-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 16px;
  margin-bottom: 7px;
}

.name-label-row label {
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-size: 0.76rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
}

.optional-tag {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-left: 6px;
  padding: 1px 5px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.49rem;
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  vertical-align: 0.16em;
}

.name-input-shell {
  display: flex;
  align-items: stretch;
  min-height: 64px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
  background: rgba(250, 246, 235, 0.63);
  transition: border-color 160ms ease, background-color 160ms ease, box-shadow 160ms ease;
}

.name-input-shell:focus-within {
  border-color: var(--teal);
  background: var(--paper-light);
  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 rgba(22, 59, 52, 0.09);
}

.name-prefix {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 0 15px;
  border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.56rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
}

.name-input-shell input {
  min-width: 0;
  flex: 1;
  padding: 13px 17px;
  border: 0;
  outline: 0;
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1.38rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.09em;
}

.name-input-shell input::placeholder {
  color: rgba(98, 109, 101, 0.76);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
}

.name-counter {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 0 15px;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.54rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

/* ---------- Talent ---------- */

.talent-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 12px;
}

.talent-option {
  position: relative;
  min-width: 0;
  padding: 20px 20px 16px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  background: rgba(250, 246, 235, 0.54);
  color: var(--ink);
  text-align: left;
  cursor: pointer;
  overflow: hidden;
  transition:
    background-color 170ms ease,
    color 170ms ease,
    border-color 170ms ease,
    transform 170ms ease,
    box-shadow 170ms ease;
}

.talent-option:hover {
  border-color: var(--line-strong);
  background: rgba(250, 246, 235, 0.95);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  box-shadow: 4px 5px 0 rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.07);
}

.talent-option.is-selected {
  border-color: var(--teal);
  background: var(--teal);
  color: var(--paper-light);
  box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 rgba(22, 59, 52, 0.15);
}

.talent-option.is-selected:hover {
  background: var(--teal);
  transform: none;
  box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 rgba(22, 59, 52, 0.15);
}

.talent-ordinal {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 8px;
  padding-right: 36px;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.53rem;
  line-height: 1.4;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
}

.talent-option.is-selected .talent-ordinal {
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.55);
}

.talent-select-mark {
  position: absolute;
  top: 15px;
  right: 15px;
  width: 21px;
  height: 21px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  color: transparent;
  transition: all 160ms ease;
}

.talent-select-mark .icon {
  width: 13px;
  height: 13px;
  stroke-width: 2.2;
}

.talent-option.is-selected .talent-select-mark {
  border-color: var(--red-soft);
  background: var(--red);
  color: var(--paper-light);
}

.talent-level {
  display: flex;
  gap: 3px;
  margin-top: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 5px;
}

.talent-level i {
  width: 13px;
  height: 3px;
  background: rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.14);
}

.talent-option.is-selected .talent-level i {
  background: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.17);
}

.talent-level i.is-on {
  background: var(--red);
}

.talent-option.is-selected .talent-level i.is-on {
  background: var(--red-soft);
}

.talent-en {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 8px;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.5rem;
  line-height: 1.4;
  letter-spacing: 0.15em;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
}

.talent-option.is-selected .talent-en {
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.55);
}

.talent-name {
  display: block;
  margin: 1px 0 8px;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1.75rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.3;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
}

.talent-tagline {
  display: block;
  margin-bottom: 6px;
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.talent-desc {
  display: block;
  min-height: 3.2em;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-size: 0.76rem;
  line-height: 1.75;
}

.talent-option.is-selected .talent-tagline {
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.85);
}

.talent-option.is-selected .talent-desc {
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.67);
}

.talent-points {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 5px;
  margin-top: 17px;
  padding-top: 13px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.talent-option.is-selected .talent-points {
  border-top-color: var(--line-light);
}

.talent-points > span {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  gap: 4px;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.talent-points b {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1.08rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.2;
}

.talent-points small {
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-size: 0.56rem;
  line-height: 1.4;
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
}

.talent-option.is-selected .talent-points small {
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.5);
}

.inline-note {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 9px;
  margin-top: 15px;
  padding: 11px 13px;
  background: rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.035);
  border-left: 2px solid var(--gold);
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.inline-note .icon {
  width: 14px;
  height: 14px;
  margin-top: 3px;
  color: var(--gold);
}

/* ---------- Attributes ---------- */

.attribute-budget {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
  gap: 18px 30px;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 18px 20px;
  margin-bottom: 17px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  background: rgba(250, 246, 235, 0.66);
}

.attribute-budget-main {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  gap: 9px;
  min-width: 140px;
}

.attribute-budget-main > span {
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
}

.attribute-budget-main strong {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 2.6rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 0.9;
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  color: var(--teal);
}

.attribute-budget-main.is-empty strong {
  color: var(--red);
}

.attribute-budget-main small {
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.58rem;
}

.attribute-budget-side {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 10px 18px;
}

.budget-progress {
  min-width: 160px;
  flex: 1;
}

.budget-progress-meta {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 5px;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.52rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
}

.budget-progress-meta b {
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-weight: 500;
}

.budget-track {
  width: 100%;
  height: 5px;
  background: rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.1);
  overflow: hidden;
}

.budget-track i {
  display: block;
  height: 100%;
  width: 0;
  background: var(--teal);
  transition: width 220ms ease;
}

.budget-track i.is-full {
  background: var(--red);
}

.allocation-tools {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 7px;
}

.tool-btn {
  padding: 4px 8px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-size: 0.64rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
  letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 150ms ease;
}

.tool-btn:hover {
  border-color: var(--teal);
  color: var(--teal);
  background: rgba(22, 59, 52, 0.04);
}

.tool-btn:disabled {
  opacity: 0.4;
  cursor: not-allowed;
}

.tool-btn:disabled:hover {
  border-color: var(--line);
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--ink-soft);
}

.attribute-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 12px;
}

.attribute-card {
  --accent: var(--teal-soft);
  position: relative;
  min-width: 0;
  padding: 18px 18px 15px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  background: rgba(250, 246, 235, 0.53);
  transition: border-color 160ms ease, background-color 160ms ease;
}

.attribute-card:hover {
  border-color: rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.25);
  background: rgba(250, 246, 235, 0.8);
}

.attribute-card::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: -1px;
  left: -1px;
  width: 33px;
  height: 2px;
  background: var(--accent);
}

.attribute-card-head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 11px;
}

.attribute-icon {
  width: 37px;
  height: 37px;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent), transparent 62%);
  border-radius: 50%;
  color: var(--accent);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent), transparent 93%);
}

.attribute-icon .icon {
  width: 19px;
  height: 19px;
}

.attribute-name {
  min-width: 0;
}

.attribute-name h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.3;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
}

.attribute-name span {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 1px;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.49rem;
  line-height: 1.3;
  letter-spacing: 0.11em;
}

.attribute-value {
  margin-left: auto;
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  gap: 2px;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.attribute-value b {
  font-size: 1.8rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1;
  color: var(--accent);
}

.attribute-value small {
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.52rem;
}

.attribute-pips {
  display: flex;
  gap: 4px;
  margin: 15px 0 12px;
}

.attribute-pips i {
  flex: 1 1 0;
  height: 4px;
  background: rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.1);
  transition: background-color 150ms ease;
}

.attribute-pips i.is-filled {
  background: var(--accent);
}

.attribute-card-desc {
  min-height: 3.1em;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-size: 0.74rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.attribute-controls {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-top: 13px;
  padding-top: 11px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.attribute-controls > span {
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.49rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.stat-btn {
  width: 28px;
  height: 28px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  line-height: 1;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 140ms ease;
}

.stat-btn:hover:not(:disabled) {
  background: var(--accent);
  border-color: var(--accent);
  color: var(--paper-light);
}

.stat-btn:disabled {
  opacity: 0.26;
  cursor: not-allowed;
}

.stat-controls-pair {
  display: flex;
  gap: 4px;
}

.attribute-budget-warning {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 8px;
  margin-top: 13px;
  color: var(--red);
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  line-height: 1.65;
}

.attribute-budget-warning .icon {
  width: 14px;
  height: 14px;
  margin-top: 3px;
}

/* ---------- Family ---------- */

.family-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 12px;
}

.family-option {
  position: relative;
  min-width: 0;
  padding: 18px 18px 16px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  background: rgba(250, 246, 235, 0.54);
  color: var(--ink);
  text-align: left;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition:
    background-color 170ms ease,
    border-color 170ms ease,
    color 170ms ease,
    transform 170ms ease,
    box-shadow 170ms ease;
}

.family-option:hover {
  background: rgba(250, 246, 235, 0.94);
  border-color: var(--line-strong);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  box-shadow: 4px 5px 0 rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.06);
}

.family-option.is-selected {
  border-color: var(--teal);
  background: var(--teal);
  color: var(--paper-light);
  box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 rgba(22, 59, 52, 0.15);
}

.family-option.is-selected:hover {
  background: var(--teal);
  transform: none;
  box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 rgba(22, 59, 52, 0.15);
}

.family-option-head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 11px;
}

.family-icon {
  width: 36px;
  height: 36px;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 50%;
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  background: rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.025);
}

.family-icon .icon {
  width: 18px;
  height: 18px;
}

.family-option.is-selected .family-icon {
  color: var(--gold-light);
  border-color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.22);
  background: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.06);
}

.family-name {
  display: block;
  min-width: 0;
}

.family-name .family-cn {
  display: block;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1.07rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.3;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
}

.family-name .family-en {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 1px;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.48rem;
  line-height: 1.3;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
}

.family-option.is-selected .family-name .family-cn {
  color: var(--paper-light);
}

.family-option.is-selected .family-name .family-en {
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.5);
}

.family-select-mark {
  margin-left: auto;
  width: 19px;
  height: 19px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  color: transparent;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
}

.family-select-mark .icon {
  width: 12px;
  height: 12px;
  stroke-width: 2.2;
}

.family-option.is-selected .family-select-mark {
  border-color: var(--red-soft);
  background: var(--red);
  color: var(--paper-light);
}

.family-desc {
  display: block;
  min-height: 3.5em;
  margin: 13px 0 12px;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  line-height: 1.72;
}

.family-option.is-selected .family-desc {
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.67);
}

.family-ledger {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 8px;
  padding: 10px 0;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.family-option.is-selected .family-ledger {
  border-color: var(--line-light);
}

.family-ledger span {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 2px;
  min-width: 0;
}

.family-ledger small {
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-size: 0.56rem;
  line-height: 1.35;
}

.family-ledger b {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 0.92rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.3;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.family-option.is-selected .family-ledger small {
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.47);
}

.family-option.is-selected .family-ledger b {
  color: var(--paper-light);
}

.family-tags {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 4px;
  margin-top: 11px;
}

.family-tags span {
  padding: 2px 6px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-size: 0.55rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.family-option.is-selected .family-tags span {
  border-color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.17);
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.67);
}

.family-note {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 9px;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-size: 0.68rem;
  line-height: 1.65;
}

.family-option.is-selected .family-note {
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.57);
}

/* ---------- Abilities ---------- */

.ability-budget {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 16px;
  padding: 16px 18px;
  margin-bottom: 17px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  background: rgba(250, 246, 235, 0.62);
}

.ability-budget-main {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  gap: 8px;
}

.ability-budget-main span {
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-size: 0.72rem;
}

.ability-budget-main strong {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 2.1rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1;
  color: var(--teal);
}

.ability-budget-main small {
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.54rem;
}

.ability-budget-side {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 14px;
}

.ability-budget-side span {
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.54rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
}

.ability-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 12px;
}

.ability-option {
  position: relative;
  min-width: 0;
  padding: 18px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  background: rgba(250, 246, 235, 0.53);
  color: var(--ink);
  text-align: left;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition:
    background-color 170ms ease,
    border-color 170ms ease,
    color 170ms ease,
    transform 170ms ease,
    opacity 170ms ease,
    box-shadow 170ms ease;
}

.ability-option:hover {
  border-color: var(--line-strong);
  background: rgba(250, 246, 235, 0.93);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  box-shadow: 4px 5px 0 rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.06);
}

.ability-option.is-selected {
  border-color: var(--teal);
  background: var(--teal);
  color: var(--paper-light);
  box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 rgba(22, 59, 52, 0.15);
}

.ability-option.is-selected:hover {
  background: var(--teal);
  transform: none;
  box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 rgba(22, 59, 52, 0.15);
}

.ability-option.is-unaffordable {
  opacity: 0.55;
}

.ability-option.is-unaffordable:hover {
  opacity: 0.8;
}

.ability-top {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 10px;
}

.ability-icon {
  width: 34px;
  height: 34px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 50%;
  color: var(--ink-soft);
}

.ability-icon .icon {
  width: 18px;
  height: 18px;
}

.ability-option.is-selected .ability-icon {
  color: var(--gold-light);
  border-color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.22);
}

.ability-cost {
  padding: 3px 7px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.52rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.ability-option.is-selected .ability-cost {
  color: var(--gold-light);
  border-color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.22);
}

.ability-option-head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 9px;
  margin-top: 11px;
}

.ability-name-block {
  display: block;
  min-width: 0;
}

.ability-name-block .ability-cn {
  display: block;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1.18rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.35;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
}

.ability-name-block .ability-en {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 1px;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.47rem;
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 1.3;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
}

.ability-option.is-selected .ability-name-block .ability-en {
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.5);
}

.ability-select-mark {
  margin-left: auto;
  width: 20px;
  height: 20px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  color: transparent;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
}

.ability-select-mark .icon {
  width: 12px;
  height: 12px;
  stroke-width: 2.2;
}

.ability-option.is-selected .ability-select-mark {
  border-color: var(--red-soft);
  background: var(--red);
  color: var(--paper-light);
}

.ability-effect {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 9px;
  padding: 8px 9px;
  background: rgba(22, 59, 52, 0.055);
  border-left: 2px solid var(--teal-soft);
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  line-height: 1.65;
}

.ability-option.is-selected .ability-effect {
  background: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.07);
  border-left-color: var(--gold-light);
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.82);
}

.ability-desc {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 8px;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-size: 0.71rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.ability-option.is-selected .ability-desc {
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.63);
}

/* ---------- School ---------- */

.school-note {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 10px;
  padding: 12px 14px;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(166, 122, 69, 0.3);
  background: rgba(166, 122, 69, 0.065);
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.school-note .icon {
  width: 15px;
  height: 15px;
  margin-top: 2px;
  color: var(--gold);
}

.school-list {
  display: grid;
  gap: 10px;
}

.school-option {
  position: relative;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 58px minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
  align-items: stretch;
  gap: 16px;
  min-width: 0;
  padding: 17px 18px 17px 0;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  background: rgba(250, 246, 235, 0.53);
  color: var(--ink);
  text-align: left;
  cursor: pointer;
  overflow: hidden;
  transition:
    background-color 170ms ease,
    border-color 170ms ease,
    color 170ms ease,
    box-shadow 170ms ease;
}

.school-option:hover {
  background: rgba(250, 246, 235, 0.95);
  border-color: var(--line-strong);
  box-shadow: 4px 5px 0 rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.06);
}

.school-option.is-selected {
  background: var(--teal);
  border-color: var(--teal);
  color: var(--paper-light);
  box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 rgba(22, 59, 52, 0.15);
}

.school-option.is-selected:hover {
  background: var(--teal);
  box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 rgba(22, 59, 52, 0.15);
}

.school-no {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  padding-top: 3px;
  border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1.7rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1;
  color: rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.28);
}

.school-option.is-selected .school-no {
  border-color: var(--line-light);
  color: var(--gold-light);
}

.school-main {
  min-width: 0;
}

.school-en {
  display: block;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.49rem;
  line-height: 1.4;
  letter-spacing: 0.11em;
}

.school-option.is-selected .school-en {
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.48);
}

.school-title-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 7px 13px;
  margin-top: 2px;
}

.school-title-row .school-name {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1.32rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.35;
  letter-spacing: 0.07em;
}

.school-title-row .school-level {
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-size: 0.62rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.03em;
}

.school-option.is-selected .school-title-row .school-level {
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.62);
}

.school-desc {
  display: block;
  max-width: 530px;
  margin-top: 6px;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  line-height: 1.72;
}

.school-option.is-selected .school-desc {
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.66);
}

.school-facts {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 6px 18px;
  margin-top: 10px;
}

.school-facts span {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  gap: 5px;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.49rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
}

.school-facts b {
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 0.62rem;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.school-option.is-selected .school-facts span {
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.56);
}

.school-option.is-selected .school-facts b {
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.85);
}

.school-side {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: flex-end;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 16px;
  min-width: 65px;
}

.difficulty-bars {
  display: flex;
  gap: 3px;
}

.difficulty-bars i {
  width: 17px;
  height: 4px;
  background: rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.12);
}

.difficulty-bars i.is-on {
  background: var(--red);
}

.school-option.is-selected .difficulty-bars i {
  background: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.16);
}

.school-option.is-selected .difficulty-bars i.is-on {
  background: var(--red-soft);
}

.school-select-circle {
  width: 23px;
  height: 23px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  color: transparent;
}

.school-select-circle .icon {
  width: 13px;
  height: 13px;
  stroke-width: 2.2;
}

.school-option.is-selected .school-select-circle {
  border-color: var(--red-soft);
  background: var(--red);
  color: var(--paper-light);
}

/* ---------- Review ---------- */

.review-lead {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 17px;
  padding: 13px 15px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  background: rgba(250, 246, 235, 0.57);
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.review-lead .icon {
  width: 17px;
  height: 17px;
  color: var(--red);
  flex: 0 0 auto;
}

.review-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 12px;
}

.review-card {
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  background: rgba(250, 246, 235, 0.55);
  padding: 18px;
}

.review-card--wide {
  grid-column: 1 / -1;
}

.review-card-head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 12px;
  padding-bottom: 10px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.review-card-head h2 {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.3;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
}

.review-card-head h2 span {
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.5rem;
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
}

.review-edit {
  padding: 0;
  border: 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.26);
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-size: 0.6rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.review-edit:hover {
  color: var(--red);
  border-color: var(--red);
}

.review-dl {
  display: grid;
  gap: 8px;
  margin: 13px 0 0;
}

.review-dl > div {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 16px;
}

.review-dl dt {
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-size: 0.64rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
}

.review-dl dd {
  margin: 0;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-size: 0.74rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1.5;
  text-align: right;
}

.review-dl dd .minor {
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-size: 0.58rem;
  font-weight: 400;
}

.review-stat-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 8px;
  margin-top: 13px;
}

.review-stat {
  padding: 8px 9px;
  background: rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.035);
}

.review-stat span {
  display: block;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-size: 0.55rem;
  line-height: 1.4;
}

.review-stat b {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 1px;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1.2rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.3;
}

.review-ability-list {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 6px;
  margin-top: 13px;
}

.review-ability-list span {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 5px;
  padding: 4px 7px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-size: 0.61rem;
  line-height: 1.4;
}

.review-ability-list span b {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.51rem;
  font-weight: 400;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
}

.review-ability-empty {
  margin-top: 13px;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-size: 0.66rem;
  font-style: italic;
}

.review-bottom {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-top: 12px;
}

.review-finance {
  padding: 16px 18px;
  background: var(--teal);
  color: var(--paper-light);
}

.review-finance h3 {
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.5);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.52rem;
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.review-finance-main {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  gap: 7px;
  margin-top: 4px;
}

.review-finance-main b {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 2rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.2;
  color: var(--gold-light);
}

.review-finance-main span {
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.55);
  font-size: 0.62rem;
}

.review-finance-row {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 14px;
  margin-top: 7px;
  padding-top: 7px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line-light);
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.7);
  font-size: 0.62rem;
}

.review-finance-row b {
  color: var(--paper-light);
  font-weight: 500;
  text-align: right;
}

.review-school-block {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 9px;
  padding: 16px 18px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  background: rgba(250, 246, 235, 0.55);
}

.review-school-block h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1.23rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.35;
}

.review-school-block p {
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-size: 0.64rem;
  line-height: 1.65;
}

.review-school-block .school-mini-meta {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 5px 12px;
  margin-top: 3px;
}

.review-school-block .school-mini-meta span {
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.48rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.03em;
}

.review-school-block .school-mini-meta b {
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 0.6rem;
}

.review-hint {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 9px;
  margin-top: 17px;
  padding-top: 15px;
  border-top: 1px dashed var(--line);
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-size: 0.66rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.review-hint .icon {
  width: 14px;
  height: 14px;
  margin-top: 3px;
  color: var(--gold);
}

/* ---------- Form actions & errors ---------- */

.form-error {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 9px;
  margin-top: 18px;
  padding: 11px 13px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(174, 59, 47, 0.32);
  background: rgba(174, 59, 47, 0.06);
  color: var(--red-deep);
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  line-height: 1.65;
  animation: shake 260ms ease;
}

.form-error .icon {
  width: 15px;
  height: 15px;
  margin-top: 3px;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
}

@keyframes shake {
  0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); }
  30% { transform: translateX(-4px); }
  65% { transform: translateX(3px); }
}

.step-actions {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 16px;
  margin-top: 34px;
  padding-top: 20px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
}

.step-actions-right {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 14px;
}

.step-action-hint {
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.51rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  text-align: right;
}

.step-action-hint b {
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-weight: 500;
}

/* ---------- Dossier ---------- */

.dossier {
  position: sticky;
  top: 24px;
  min-width: 0;
  background: var(--teal);
  color: var(--paper);
  border: 1px solid rgba(14, 43, 38, 0.45);
  box-shadow:
    9px 10px 0 rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.09),
    0 22px 44px rgba(35, 42, 33, 0.12);
  overflow: hidden;
}

.dossier::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 9px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.12);
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 1;
}

.dossier::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 28px;
  left: -7px;
  width: 14px;
  height: 14px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--paper);
  border: 1px solid rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.25);
  box-shadow: 0 calc(100% + 0px) 0 var(--paper);
  z-index: 2;
}

.dossier-inner {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
  padding: 23px 23px 20px;
}

.dossier-tab {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 10px;
  padding-bottom: 12px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.19);
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.56);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.51rem;
  line-height: 1.4;
  letter-spacing: 0.11em;
}

.dossier-tab b {
  color: var(--gold-light);
  font-weight: 400;
}

.dossier-register-mark {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  padding: 1px 5px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(209, 116, 99, 0.5);
  color: var(--red-soft) !important;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 0.52rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
}

.dossier-name-block {
  padding: 18px 0 14px;
}

.dossier-label {
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.46);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.5rem;
  line-height: 1.4;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
}

.dossier-name {
  margin-top: 2px;
  color: var(--paper-light);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: clamp(2rem, 2.9vw, 2.65rem);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.25;
  letter-spacing: 0.07em;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

.dossier-name.is-placeholder {
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.55);
}

.dossier-subline {
  margin-top: 3px;
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.48);
  font-size: 0.63rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.dossier-meta {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 11px 14px;
  padding: 13px 0;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.16);
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.16);
}

.dossier-meta > div {
  min-width: 0;
}

.dossier-meta dt {
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.4);
  font-size: 0.54rem;
  line-height: 1.45;
}

.dossier-meta dd {
  margin: 2px 0 0;
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.9);
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 1.55;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

.dossier-meta dd.is-muted {
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.32);
  font-weight: 400;
}

.dossier-stats-head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-top: 14px;
}

.dossier-stats-head h3 {
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.53);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.5rem;
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 1.5;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.dossier-stats-head span {
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.34);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.48rem;
}

.dossier-stat-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 8px 14px;
  margin-top: 9px;
}

.dossier-stat-line {
  min-width: 0;
}

.dossier-stat-label {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 5px;
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.62);
  font-size: 0.58rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.dossier-stat-label b {
  color: var(--paper-light);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 0.84rem;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.dossier-stat-track {
  height: 2px;
  margin-top: 3px;
  background: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.12);
}

.dossier-stat-track i {
  display: block;
  height: 100%;
  background: var(--gold-light);
  opacity: 0.7;
  transition: width 200ms ease;
}

.dossier-ability-block {
  margin-top: 14px;
  padding-top: 12px;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.16);
}

.dossier-ability-list {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 4px;
  margin-top: 7px;
}

.dossier-ability-list span {
  padding: 2px 6px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.18);
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.7);
  font-size: 0.53rem;
  line-height: 1.55;
}

.dossier-ability-list .is-empty {
  padding: 0;
  border: 0;
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.34);
  font-style: italic;
}

.dossier-finance {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 8px;
  margin-top: 14px;
  padding-top: 12px;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.16);
}

.dossier-finance span {
  display: block;
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.4);
  font-size: 0.52rem;
  line-height: 1.4;
}

.dossier-finance b {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 1px;
  color: var(--gold-light);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 0.93rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.4;
}

.dossier-footer {
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-top: 16px;
  padding-top: 12px;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.16);
}

.dossier-barcode {
  width: 92px;
  height: 24px;
  opacity: 0.35;
  background: repeating-linear-gradient(
    90deg,
    var(--paper) 0,
    var(--paper) 1px,
    transparent 1px,
    transparent 4px,
    var(--paper) 4px,
    var(--paper) 6px,
    transparent 6px,
    transparent 8px
  );
}

.dossier-footer small {
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.29);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.43rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
  letter-spacing: 0.07em;
  text-align: right;
}

.dossier-completion {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  margin-top: 11px;
}

.dossier-completion span {
  width: 13px;
  height: 2px;
  background: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.16);
}

.dossier-completion span.is-done {
  background: var(--gold-light);
}

.dossier-completion small {
  margin-left: auto;
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.32);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.44rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
}

/* ---------- Toast ---------- */

.toast-region {
  position: fixed;
  left: 50%;
  bottom: 24px;
  z-index: 2600;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  width: min(92vw, 460px);
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  pointer-events: none;
}

.toast {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 9px;
  width: max-content;
  max-width: 100%;
  padding: 10px 14px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.18);
  background: var(--ink);
  color: var(--paper-light);
  box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.22);
  font-size: 0.73rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  animation: toast-in 200ms ease both;
}

.toast.is-leaving {
  animation: toast-out 180ms ease both;
}

.toast .icon {
  width: 15px;
  height: 15px;
  margin-top: 2px;
  color: var(--gold-light);
}

@keyframes toast-in {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}

@keyframes toast-out {
  from { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  to { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(5px); }
}

/* ---------- Native confirm dialog ---------- */

.confirm-dialog {
  width: min(92vw, 470px);
  padding: 0;
  border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  background: var(--paper-light);
  color: var(--ink);
  box-shadow: 0 30px 70px rgba(14, 43, 38, 0.28);
}

.confirm-dialog::backdrop {
  background: rgba(14, 43, 38, 0.65);
  backdrop-filter: blur(3px);
}

.confirm-shell {
  position: relative;
  padding: 30px 30px 24px;
}

.confirm-shell::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 15px;
  left: 15px;
  right: 15px;
  bottom: 15px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  pointer-events: none;
}

.dialog-eyebrow {
  position: relative;
  color: var(--red);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.55rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
}

.confirm-dialog h2 {
  position: relative;
  margin-top: 9px;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1.65rem;
  line-height: 1.35;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
}

.dialog-body {
  position: relative;
  margin-top: 11px;
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  line-height: 1.85;
}

.dialog-actions {
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  gap: 9px;
  margin-top: 25px;
}

/* ---------- Admission overlay ---------- */

.admission-overlay {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 2000;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: flex-start;
  overflow-y: auto;
  padding: clamp(16px, 4vh, 46px) 18px;
  background: rgba(10, 33, 29, 0.82);
  backdrop-filter: blur(7px);
  animation: fade-in 260ms ease both;
}

@keyframes fade-in {
  from { opacity: 0; }
  to { opacity: 1; }
}

.admission-letter {
  position: relative;
  width: min(740px, 100%);
  margin: auto;
  padding: clamp(30px, 5vw, 54px) clamp(24px, 5.8vw, 68px) 30px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.3);
  background:
    linear-gradient(150deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25), transparent 30%),
    var(--paper-light);
  box-shadow:
    0 0 0 8px rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.1),
    0 35px 90px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  animation: letter-in 520ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.75, 0.2, 1) both;
}

@keyframes letter-in {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px) rotate(-0.5deg) scale(0.985); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) rotate(0) scale(1); }
}

.admission-letter::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 12px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  pointer-events: none;
}

.letter-close {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 2;
  top: 15px;
  right: 15px;
  width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
  border: 1px solid transparent;
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.letter-close:hover {
  border-color: var(--line);
  color: var(--red);
}

.letter-close .icon {
  width: 17px;
  height: 17px;
}

.letter-kicker {
  color: var(--red);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.55rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.letter-head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 20px;
  margin-top: 19px;
  padding-bottom: 20px;
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
}

.letter-title-block h2 {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 3.8rem);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.12;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
}

.letter-title-block p {
  margin-top: 4px;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.54rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
}

.letter-crest {
  width: 64px;
  height: 64px;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  border: 1px solid var(--teal);
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  position: relative;
  color: var(--teal);
}

.letter-crest::before,
.letter-crest::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  background: var(--red);
}

.letter-crest::before {
  width: 25px;
  height: 1px;
}

.letter-crest::after {
  width: 1px;
  height: 25px;
}

.letter-crest span {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 7px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(22, 59, 52, 0.22);
  border-radius: 50%;
}

.letter-meta {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 7px 20px;
  padding: 13px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.52rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.07em;
}

.letter-salutation {
  margin-top: 25px;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1.17rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.8;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
}

.letter-body {
  margin-top: 15px;
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 0.96rem;
  line-height: 2;
  letter-spacing: 0.025em;
  text-align: justify;
}

.letter-body strong {
  color: var(--ink);
  font-weight: 700;
}

.letter-emphasis {
  padding: 13px 16px;
  border-left: 2px solid var(--red);
  background: rgba(174, 59, 47, 0.035);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-size: 0.84rem;
  line-height: 1.9;
}

.letter-signature {
  margin-top: 30px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 24px;
}

.letter-signature-text {
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 0.83rem;
  line-height: 1.9;
  text-align: right;
}

.letter-signature-text b {
  color: var(--ink);
  font-weight: 700;
}

.letter-seal {
  width: 86px;
  height: 86px;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  border: 2px solid rgba(174, 59, 47, 0.78);
  outline: 1px solid rgba(174, 59, 47, 0.4);
  outline-offset: -6px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: grid;
  place-content: center;
  justify-items: center;
  color: var(--red);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 0.6rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.2;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  transform: rotate(-9deg);
  opacity: 0.88;
  animation: seal-in 400ms 420ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.75, 0.2, 1) both;
}

@keyframes seal-in {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: rotate(-18deg) scale(1.35); }
  to { opacity: 0.88; transform: rotate(-9deg) scale(1); }
}

.letter-seal::before {
  content: "";
  width: 25px;
  height: 1px;
  margin-bottom: 3px;
  background: currentColor;
}

.letter-footer {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 20px;
  margin-top: 22px;
  padding-top: 17px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.letter-footer small {
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.46rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  letter-spacing: 0.07em;
}

.letter-actions {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-top: 23px;
}

.letter-perforation {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 88px;
  height: 1px;
  background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, var(--line-strong) 0 4px, transparent 4px 9px);
  opacity: 0.45;
  pointer-events: none;
}

/* ---------- Arrival / prologue ---------- */

.arrival-screen {
  position: relative;
  min-height: 100svh;
  overflow: hidden;
  background:
    radial-gradient(120% 100% at 0% 0%, rgba(53, 105, 91, 0.4), transparent 58%),
    var(--teal-deep);
  color: var(--paper);
}

.arrival-screen::before {
  content: "白袍之前";
  position: absolute;
  right: -2vw;
  bottom: -12vh;
  color: transparent;
  -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.06);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: clamp(150px, 28vw, 380px);
  line-height: 0.8;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  writing-mode: vertical-rl;
  pointer-events: none;
  user-select: none;
}

.arrival-screen::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 220 220' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.8' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='0.45'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
  opacity: 0.06;
  mix-blend-mode: screen;
}

.arrival-header {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 5;
  max-width: 1420px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 22px var(--page-pad) 16px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 20px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.15);
}

.arrival-header .brand {
  color: var(--paper);
}

.arrival-header .brand-mark {
  border-color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.45);
}

.arrival-header .brand-mark::before,
.arrival-header .brand-mark::after {
  background: var(--red-soft);
}

.arrival-header .brand-mark span {
  border-color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.14);
}

.arrival-header .brand-text small {
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.4);
}

.arrival-header-meta {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 11px;
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.45);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.55rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
}

.arrival-header-meta .meta-line {
  width: 30px;
  height: 1px;
  background: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.3);
}

.arrival-layout {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
  max-width: 1350px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: clamp(30px, 6vh, 72px) var(--page-pad) 58px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(250px, 0.7fr) minmax(0, 1.12fr);
  gap: clamp(36px, 7vw, 110px);
  align-items: start;
}

.arrival-hero {
  position: sticky;
  top: 44px;
  padding-top: 5px;
}

.arrival-chapter-no {
  display: block;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.22);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 7rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 0.65;
  letter-spacing: -0.08em;
}

.arrival-kicker {
  color: var(--gold-light);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.57rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
}

.arrival-title {
  margin-top: 15px;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: clamp(3.7rem, 7vw, 6.8rem);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 0.95;
  letter-spacing: -0.045em;
}

.arrival-title span {
  display: block;
}

.arrival-title span:last-child {
  margin-left: clamp(20px, 4vw, 58px);
  color: transparent;
  -webkit-text-stroke: 1.2px rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.8);
}

.arrival-hero-rule {
  width: 64px;
  height: 2px;
  margin: 28px 0 20px;
  background: var(--red-soft);
}

.arrival-quote {
  max-width: 320px;
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.58);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 0.84rem;
  line-height: 1.95;
  letter-spacing: 0.045em;
}

.arrival-meta {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 9px 22px;
  margin-top: 34px;
  padding-top: 14px;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.15);
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.37);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.49rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
}

.arrival-meta b {
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.68);
  font-weight: 400;
}

.story-paper {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  background:
    linear-gradient(150deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35), transparent 28%),
    var(--paper-light);
  color: var(--ink);
  border: 1px solid rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.27);
  box-shadow:
    14px 16px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12),
    0 30px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
}

.story-paper::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 12px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  pointer-events: none;
}

.story-inner {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  padding: clamp(25px, 4.5vw, 48px);
}

.story-topline {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 16px;
  padding-bottom: 13px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.51rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
}

.story-topline span:last-child {
  color: var(--red);
  text-align: right;
}

.story-headline {
  margin-top: 24px;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.5;
  letter-spacing: 0.03em;
}

.story-headline em {
  color: var(--red);
  font-style: normal;
}

.story-body {
  margin-top: 24px;
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 0.93rem;
  line-height: 2.05;
  letter-spacing: 0.025em;
}

.story-body p {
  margin-top: 14px;
}

.story-body p:first-child {
  margin-top: 0;
}

.story-drop {
  color: var(--red);
  font-size: 1.22em;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
}

.story-body .story-aside {
  margin: 22px 0;
  padding: 12px 0 12px 17px;
  border-left: 2px solid var(--gold);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-size: 0.88rem;
  line-height: 1.9;
}

.story-profile {
  position: relative;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 10px 20px;
  margin-top: 28px;
  padding: 16px;
  background: rgba(22, 59, 52, 0.045);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.story-profile > div {
  min-width: 0;
}

.story-profile span {
  display: block;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.47rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
}

.story-profile b {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 2px;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.5;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

.story-profile .story-finance {
  grid-column: 1 / -1;
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 16px;
  margin-top: 2px;
  padding-top: 9px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.story-profile .story-finance span {
  display: inline;
}

.story-profile .story-finance b {
  color: var(--red);
  font-size: 1rem;
}

.story-actions {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 17px;
  margin-top: 27px;
  padding-top: 19px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.story-actions small {
  max-width: 180px;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 0.65rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.story-actions .btn {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
}

.story-stamp {
  position: absolute;
  right: 25px;
  bottom: 100px;
  width: 74px;
  height: 74px;
  border: 1.5px solid rgba(174, 59, 47, 0.7);
  outline: 1px solid rgba(174, 59, 47, 0.32);
  outline-offset: -5px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: grid;
  place-content: center;
  justify-items: center;
  color: var(--red);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 0.64rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.25;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  transform: rotate(-10deg);
  opacity: 0.68;
  pointer-events: none;
}

/* ---------- Complete / archive ---------- */

.complete-screen {
  position: relative;
  min-height: 100svh;
  background:
    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.022) 1px, transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.016) 1px, transparent 1px),
    var(--paper);
  background-size: 34px 34px;
}

.complete-screen::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  height: 7px;
  background: var(--teal);
}

.complete-header {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 1260px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 28px clamp(18px, 3.5vw, 42px) 16px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 20px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.complete-header-meta {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 11px;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.54rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
}

.complete-header-meta i {
  width: 5px;
  height: 5px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--red);
}

.complete-main {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 1120px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: clamp(35px, 6vh, 70px) clamp(18px, 3.5vw, 42px) 65px;
}

.result-hero {
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 38px;
  padding-bottom: 31px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
}

.result-kicker {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 11px;
  color: var(--red);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.59rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.15em;
}

.result-kicker::before {
  content: "";
  width: 26px;
  height: 2px;
  background: var(--red);
}

.result-hero h1 {
  margin-top: 14px;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: clamp(3.1rem, 6.5vw, 6.4rem);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 0.98;
  letter-spacing: -0.045em;
}

.result-hero h1 em {
  color: var(--red);
  font-style: normal;
}

.result-hero-copy {
  max-width: 720px;
}

.result-sub {
  max-width: 470px;
  margin-top: 20px;
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  line-height: 1.95;
  letter-spacing: 0.03em;
}

.result-stamp {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  width: 108px;
  height: 108px;
  border: 2px solid rgba(174, 59, 47, 0.7);
  outline: 1px solid rgba(174, 59, 47, 0.4);
  outline-offset: -7px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: grid;
  place-content: center;
  justify-items: center;
  color: var(--red);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 0.77rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.25;
  letter-spacing: 0.13em;
  transform: rotate(-11deg);
  opacity: 0.85;
  animation: seal-in 500ms 200ms ease both;
}

.result-stamp b {
  font-size: 1.02rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.2em;
}

.result-stamp span {
  margin-top: 2px;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.35rem;
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 1.4;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
}

.archive-sheet {
  position: relative;
  margin-top: 30px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
  background: rgba(250, 246, 235, 0.74);
  box-shadow: 8px 9px 0 rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.075);
}

.archive-sheet::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 10px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  pointer-events: none;
}

.archive-sheet-inner {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  padding: clamp(22px, 4vw, 38px);
}

.sheet-top {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 22px;
  padding-bottom: 16px;
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
}

.sheet-top .eyebrow {
  color: var(--ink-faint);
}

.sheet-school {
  margin-top: 5px;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.4;
  letter-spacing: 0.07em;
}

.sheet-no {
  text-align: right;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.51rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
}

.sheet-no b {
  display: block;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-size: 0.63rem;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.sheet-identity {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(0, 0.8fr);
  gap: 24px;
  padding: 21px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.sheet-name-label {
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.5rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
}

.sheet-name {
  margin-top: 1px;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.25;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

.sheet-name small {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 2px;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: 0.03em;
}

.sheet-identity-meta {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 9px 16px;
  align-content: center;
}

.sheet-identity-meta span {
  display: block;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.47rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
}

.sheet-identity-meta b {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 1px;
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-size: 0.71rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.sheet-columns {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
  gap: 28px;
  padding-top: 19px;
}

.sheet-section + .sheet-section {
  margin-top: 21px;
}

.sheet-section-title {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.49rem;
  line-height: 1.4;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.sheet-section-title::before {
  content: "";
  width: 4px;
  height: 4px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--red);
}

.sheet-attribute-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 9px 23px;
  margin-top: 10px;
}

.sheet-attr-label {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 7px;
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-size: 0.63rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.sheet-attr-label b {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 0.84rem;
  line-height: 1.2;
}

.sheet-attr-track {
  height: 2px;
  margin-top: 4px;
  background: rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.1);
}

.sheet-attr-track i {
  display: block;
  height: 100%;
  background: var(--teal-soft);
}

.sheet-note {
  margin-top: 8px;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-size: 0.64rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.sheet-ability-tags {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 5px;
  margin-top: 10px;
}

.sheet-ability-tags span {
  padding: 3px 7px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  font-size: 0.59rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.sheet-ability-tags span b {
  margin-left: 4px;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.48rem;
  font-weight: 400;
}

.sheet-finance-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 11px;
  margin-top: 10px;
}

.sheet-finance-cell {
  padding: 10px 11px;
  background: rgba(22, 59, 52, 0.045);
  border-left: 2px solid var(--teal-soft);
}

.sheet-finance-cell span {
  display: block;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-size: 0.53rem;
  line-height: 1.45;
}

.sheet-finance-cell b {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 2px;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.4;
}

.sheet-foot {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 22px;
  margin-top: 23px;
  padding-top: 14px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.sheet-foot .barcode {
  color: var(--ink);
  opacity: 0.32;
  height: 24px;
  max-width: 140px;
}

.sheet-foot small {
  color: var(--ink-faint);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.45rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  text-align: right;
}

.result-actions {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-top: 27px;
}

.result-actions .result-spacer {
  flex: 1;
}

.next-chapter {
  position: relative;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
  gap: 24px;
  align-items: center;
  margin-top: 25px;
  padding: 22px 24px;
  background: var(--teal);
  color: var(--paper);
  overflow: hidden;
}

.next-chapter::before {
  content: "NEXT";
  position: absolute;
  right: 17%;
  top: -10px;
  color: transparent;
  -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.09);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 6.5rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.next-chapter .next-label {
  color: var(--gold-light);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.5rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
}

.next-chapter h2 {
  position: relative;
  margin-top: 5px;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1.42rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.45;
  letter-spacing: 0.03em;
}

.next-chapter p {
  position: relative;
  margin-top: 5px;
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.5);
  font-size: 0.66rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.next-chapter .next-state {
  position: relative;
  padding: 9px 13px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.24);
  color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.7);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.52rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

/* ---------- No script ---------- */

.noscript-card {
  position: fixed;
  inset: auto 20px 20px;
  z-index: 3000;
  padding: 16px;
  border: 1px solid var(--red);
  background: var(--paper-light);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  text-align: center;
}

/* =========================================================
   Responsive
   ========================================================= */

@media (max-width: 1180px) {
  .cover-main {
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(300px, 0.65fr);
    gap: 34px;
  }

  .cover-art {
    width: min(100%, 400px);
    padding-left: 0;
  }

  .cover-title {
    font-size: clamp(72px, 9vw, 115px);
  }

  .archive-card {
    padding-inline: 24px;
  }

  .creator-shell {
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 320px;
    gap: 30px;
  }

  .dossier-inner {
    padding-inline: 20px;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 1020px) {
  .cover-screen::before {
    left: 8%;
    font-size: 500px;
  }

  .cover-screen::after {
    right: -290px;
  }

  .cover-main {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 34px;
    padding-top: 38px;
  }

  .cover-copy {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .cover-title {
    font-size: clamp(76px, 14vw, 124px);
  }

  .cover-art {
    width: min(100%, 480px);
    justify-self: start;
    padding-left: 4px;
    margin-left: 2vw;
  }

  .cover-screen {
    min-height: auto;
  }

  .cover-main {
    padding-bottom: 44px;
  }

  .cover-footer {
    padding-top: 14px;
  }

  .creator-shell {
    display: block;
    max-width: 760px;
    padding-top: 26px;
  }

  .dossier {
    display: none;
  }

  .mobile-filebar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    padding: 9px 12px;
    background: var(--teal);
    color: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid rgba(14, 43, 38, 0.4);
    box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 rgba(24, 39, 32, 0.08);
  }

  .mobile-filebar .filebar-mark {
    width: 27px;
    height: 27px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.25);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    color: var(--gold-light);
    flex: 0 0 auto;
  }

  .mobile-filebar .filebar-mark .icon {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
  }

  .mobile-filebar-main {
    min-width: 0;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .mobile-filebar-main span {
    display: block;
    color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.44);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.44rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .mobile-filebar-main b {
    display: block;
    overflow: hidden;
    color: var(--paper-light);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 0.77rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.4;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .mobile-filebar-meta {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    color: rgba(242, 236, 221, 0.62);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.5rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .arrival-layout {
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 27px;
    padding-top: 35px;
  }

  .arrival-hero {
    position: static;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: 2px 20px;
    align-items: end;
  }

  .arrival-chapter-no {
    grid-row: 1 / span 3;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    font-size: 5.3rem;
  }

  .arrival-kicker {
    grid-column: 2;
    align-self: end;
  }

  .arrival-title {
    grid-column: 2;
    margin-top: 4px;
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 8vw, 4.4rem);
  }

  .arrival-title span {
    display: inline;
  }

  .arrival-title span:last-child {
    margin-left: 0.18em;
  }

  .arrival-hero-rule,
  .arrival-quote {
    display: none;
  }

  .arrival-meta {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    margin-top: 15px;
  }

  .story-paper {
    max-width: 820px;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 760px) {
  :root {
    --page-pad: 18px;
  }

  body::after {
    background-size: 48px 48px;
  }

  .cover-header {
    padding-top: 18px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
  }

  .brand-text strong {
    font-size: 0.96rem;
  }

  .cover-header-meta {
    display: none;
  }

  .cover-title {
    font-size: clamp(62px, 17vw, 112px);
    line-height: 0.92;
  }

  .cover-title-line:last-child {
    margin-left: 8vw;
  }

  .cover-kicker {
    margin-bottom: 25px;
  }

  .cover-intro {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 27px;
    padding-top: 20px;
  }

  .cover-lede {
    font-size: 0.93rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .cover-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .cover-actions .btn {
    justify-content: center;
    flex: 0 1 auto;
    padding-inline: 17px;
  }

  .cover-actions .text-btn {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .cover-facts {
    gap: 8px 16px;
    margin-top: 29px;
  }

  .cover-facts b {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .cover-art {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 380px;
    margin: 5px auto 0;
    padding: 19px 0 0;
  }

  .art-orbit {
    width: 390px;
    height: 390px;
    right: -45%;
  }

  .archive-card {
    width: calc(100% - 14px);
    padding: 27px 20px 18px;
  }

  .archive-tab {
    left: 17px;
  }

  .archive-name {
    font-size: 2rem;
  }

  .archive-quote {
    font-size: 0.76rem;
  }

  .archive-stamp {
    right: 17px;
    bottom: 45px;
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    font-size: 0.62rem;
  }

  .archive-caption {
    width: calc(100% - 12px);
    margin-top: 17px;
  }

  .cover-footer {
    align-items: flex-start;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 0.49rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .cover-footer .footer-chapters {
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .creator-header-inner {
    min-height: 60px;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .creator-header .brand-text small {
    display: none;
  }

  .autosave-note {
    display: none;
  }

  .creator-header-tools {
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .creator-header-tools .text-btn {
    padding: 8px 0;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
  }

  .step-nav-inner {
    padding: 0;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
  }

  .step-tab {
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 11px 2px;
    border-left: 0;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-size: 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .step-tab:last-child {
    border-right: 0;
  }

  .step-tab .step-tab-no {
    font-size: 0.58rem;
  }

  .step-tab[aria-current="step"] {
    border-top-width: 2px;
  }

  .step-tab[aria-current="step"] .step-tab-label {
    display: none;
  }

  .creator-shell {
    padding: 20px 16px 42px;
  }

  .mobile-filebar {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .step-heading {
    margin-bottom: 23px;
    padding-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .step-eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 13px;
    font-size: 0.53rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.09em;
  }

  .step-number {
    font-size: 3rem;
  }

  .step-heading h1 {
    font-size: 1.9rem;
  }

  .step-lead {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .name-input-shell {
    min-height: 56px;
  }

  .name-prefix {
    padding-inline: 10px;
    font-size: 0.49rem;
  }

  .name-input-shell input {
    padding: 11px 12px;
    font-size: 1.16rem;
  }

  .name-counter {
    padding-inline: 10px;
    font-size: 0.48rem;
  }

  .talent-grid,
  .attribute-grid,
  .family-grid,
  .ability-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .talent-option,
  .family-option,
  .ability-option {
    padding: 16px;
  }

  .talent-desc {
    min-height: 0;
  }

  .family-desc {
    min-height: 0;
  }

  .talent-points {
    margin-top: 13px;
    padding-top: 11px;
  }

  .attribute-budget {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 11px;
    padding: 14px;
  }

  .attribute-budget-main {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .attribute-budget-main strong {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
  }

  .attribute-budget-side {
    gap: 11px;
  }

  .budget-progress {
    min-width: 120px;
  }

  .attribute-card {
    padding: 15px;
  }

  .attribute-card-desc {
    min-height: 0;
  }

  .allocation-tools {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .tool-btn {
    flex: 1;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section-heading-row {
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .section-heading-row h2 {
    font-size: 1.13rem;
  }

  .section-heading-row .section-meta {
    display: none;
  }

  .form-section + .form-section {
    margin-top: 29px;
    padding-top: 26px;
  }

  .family-ledger {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  }

  .school-option {
    grid-template-columns: 37px minmax(0, 1fr) 35px;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 14px 12px 14px 0;
  }

  .school-no {
    font-size: 1.28rem;
    padding-top: 2px;
  }

  .school-title-row {
    gap: 5px 9px;
  }

  .school-title-row .school-name {
    font-size: 1.14rem;
  }

  .school-title-row .school-level {
    font-size: 0.56rem;
  }

  .school-desc {
    font-size: 0.71rem;
  }

  .school-facts {
    gap: 5px 10px;
  }

  .school-side {
    min-width: 0;
    gap: 11px;
    align-items: flex-end;
  }

  .difficulty-bars {
    gap: 2px;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-end;
  }

  .difficulty-bars i {
    width: 21px;
    height: 3px;
  }

  .school-select-circle {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
  }

  .review-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .review-card--wide {
    grid-column: auto;
  }

  .review-bottom {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .review-stat-grid {
    gap: 5px;
  }

  .review-card {
    padding: 15px;
  }

  .review-lead {
    padding: 11px 12px;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
  }

  .step-actions {
    align-items: stretch;
    flex-direction: column-reverse;
    gap: 11px;
    margin-top: 25px;
  }

  .step-actions > .btn {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .step-actions-right {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 8px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .step-actions-right .btn {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .step-action-hint {
    order: -1;
    align-self: stretch;
    font-size: 0.51rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .ability-budget {
    padding: 13px 14px;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .ability-budget-side {
    width: 100%;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .inline-note {
    font-size: 0.71rem;
  }

  .admission-overlay {
    padding: 0;
    align-items: stretch;
    background: var(--paper-light);
  }

  .admission-letter {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 100svh;
    margin: 0;
    border: 0;
    box-shadow: none;
    padding: 36px 22px 27px;
    animation: fade-in 250ms ease both;
  }

  .admission-letter::before {
    inset: 7px;
  }

  .letter-close {
    top: 8px;
    right: 8px;
  }

  .letter-title-block h2 {
    font-size: 2.4rem;
  }

  .letter-crest {
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
  }

  .letter-meta {
    font-size: 0.53rem;
    gap: 6px 14px;
  }

  .letter-salutation {
    margin-top: 21px;
    font-size: 1.04rem;
  }

  .letter-body {
    margin-top: 13px;
    font-size: 0.87rem;
    line-height: 1.95;
  }

  .letter-emphasis {
    font-size: 0.77rem;
  }

  .letter-signature {
    margin-top: 22px;
  }

  .letter-seal {
    width: 73px;
    height: 73px;
    font-size: 0.54rem;
  }

  .letter-footer {
    margin-top: 16px;
    padding-top: 14px;
  }

  .letter-actions {
    flex-direction: column-reverse;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .letter-actions .btn {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .letter-perforation {
    display: none;
  }

  .arrival-header {
    padding-top: 16px;
    padding-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .arrival-header .brand-text small {
    display: none;
  }

  .arrival-header-meta {
    font-size: 0.49rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .arrival-header-meta .meta-line,
  .arrival-header-meta span:last-child {
    display: none;
  }

  .arrival-layout {
    padding-top: 25px;
    padding-bottom: 34px;
  }

  .arrival-chapter-no {
    font-size: 3.8rem;
  }

  .arrival-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.45rem, 10vw, 3.5rem);
  }

  .arrival-meta {
    margin-top: 12px;
    gap: 6px 14px;
    font-size: 0.45rem;
  }

  .story-inner {
    padding: 22px 17px;
  }

  .story-topline {
    font-size: 0.46rem;
  }

  .story-headline {
    margin-top: 18px;
    font-size: 1.55rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .story-body {
    margin-top: 19px;
    font-size: 0.87rem;
    line-height: 1.95;
  }

  .story-profile {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 9px 12px;
    padding: 12px;
  }

  .story-profile b {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }

  .story-actions {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 15px;
  }

  .story-actions small {
    max-width: none;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .story-actions .btn {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .story-stamp {
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    right: 16px;
    bottom: 98px;
    font-size: 0.53rem;
  }

  .complete-header {
    padding-top: 21px;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .complete-header-meta {
    font-size: 0.48rem;
  }

  .complete-header .brand-text strong {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .complete-main {
    padding-top: 31px;
    padding-bottom: 42px;
  }

  .result-hero {
    display: block;
    padding-bottom: 23px;
  }

  .result-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.9rem, 14vw, 4.6rem);
  }

  .result-sub {
    margin-top: 15px;
    font-size: 0.83rem;
  }

  .result-stamp {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    width: 74px;
    height: 74px;
    font-size: 0.57rem;
  }

  .result-stamp b {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  .archive-sheet-inner {
    padding: 20px 16px;
  }

  .sheet-top {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 9px;
    padding-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .sheet-school {
    font-size: 0.96rem;
  }

  .sheet-no {
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 0.48rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .sheet-no b {
    font-size: 0.6rem;
  }

  .sheet-identity {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 15px 0;
  }

  .sheet-name {
    font-size: 2.3rem;
  }

  .sheet-identity-meta {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 7px 12px;
  }

  .sheet-columns {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 18px;
    padding-top: 15px;
  }

  .sheet-section + .sheet-section {
    margin-top: 17px;
  }

  .sheet-foot {
    margin-top: 17px;
    padding-top: 11px;
  }

  .result-actions {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 18px;
  }

  .result-actions .btn {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .result-actions .result-spacer {
    display: none;
  }

  .next-chapter {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 13px;
    padding: 18px;
    margin-top: 15px;
  }

  .next-chapter h2 {
    font-size: 1.18rem;
  }

  .next-chapter .next-state {
    justify-self: start;
    font-size: 0.49rem;
  }

  .next-chapter::before {
    right: -3%;
    font-size: 5rem;
  }

  .toast-region {
    bottom: 14px;
  }

  .toast {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
  }

  .confirm-shell {
    padding: 25px 21px 19px;
  }

  .confirm-dialog h2 {
    font-size: 1.42rem;
  }

  .dialog-actions {
    flex-direction: column-reverse;
    gap: 7px;
  }

  .dialog-actions .btn {
    width: 100%;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 430px) {
  .cover-actions {
    align-items: stretch;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .cover-actions .btn {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .cover-actions .text-btn {
    align-self: center;
  }

  .cover-title {
    font-size: clamp(58px, 17.5vw, 80px);
  }

  .cover-facts .fact-arrow {
    display: none;
  }

  .cover-facts .fact {
    flex: 0 1 45%;
  }

  .review-stat-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  }

  .result-stamp {
    width: 65px;
    height: 65px;
    opacity: 0.65;
  }

  .sheet-name {
    font-size: 1.92rem;
  }
}

/* ---------- Reduced motion ---------- */

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *,
  *::before,
  *::after {
    scroll-behavior: auto !important;
    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
    animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
  }
}

Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.log
.chrome-profile/
